The SGLang worker integration is adapted from SGLang 0.5.22
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang), licensed under Apache-2.0.
The implementation uses the native SGLang speculative verification API.

The diagonal triangular recurrence in fc1_block_inverse.py is adapted
from Flash Linear Attention's solve_tril implementation (MIT license).
Its license is reproduced in licenses/FLASH_LINEAR_ATTENTION-LICENSE.

The sample questions are from OpenAI GSM8K (MIT license):
https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math
See licenses/GSM8K-LICENSE. No answers or corpus responses are distributed.

Changes in this release package: remove experiment-only audit and baseline
branches, replace machine-local paths with user configuration, package the
existing DForkTree plugin, and add installation/download/example wrappers.
The PMI, tree-search, GDN verification and state-commit math is unchanged.
